# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules.
#
# Consolidate www → apex so Google sees a single canonical host. Without
# this, the SEO crawl reports apex and www as duplicates and link equity
# splits across both subdomains.
#
# Syntax: https://www.linkpower.app/<path> 301-redirects to
# https://linkpower.app/<path>. The `:splat` placeholder forwards the
# matched segment so deep-links keep working.

https://www.linkpower.app/* https://linkpower.app/:splat 301
http://www.linkpower.app/*  https://linkpower.app/:splat 301
http://linkpower.app/*      https://linkpower.app/:splat 301
